msgid ""
"Native Speech Generation now uses a WebSocket connection. For the best "
"performance and compatibility, restart NVDA, open NVDA Settings, select "
"Native Speech Generation, and choose Reinstall Libraries."
msgstr ""
"Native Speech Generation ahora utiliza una conexión WebSocket. Para obtener "
"el mejor rendimiento y compatibilidad, reinicie NVDA, abra las opciones de "
"NVDA, seleccione Native Speech Generation y elija Reinstalar bibliotecas."

#. Translators: Title of the warning shown after updating the add-on.
msgid "Native Speech Generation updated"
msgstr "Native Speech Generation actualizado"

#. Translators: Long description for this add-on shown in NVDA's Add-ons Store and Add-ons Manager.
msgid ""
"Harness the power of Google's state-of-the-art Gemini AI for high-quality "
"speech generation directly within NVDA. This add-on provides a user-friendly "
"dialog to convert text into natural-sounding audio.\n"
"\n"
"Key Features:\n"
"- High-Quality Voices: Choose between Gemini Flash 3.1 Preview for powerful, "
"low-latency short audio, Gemini Flash 2.5 for standard responsive "
"generation, and Gemini Pro 2.5 for premium, life-like speech.\n"
"- Single and Multi-Speaker Modes: Easily generate audio for a single speaker "
"or create dynamic dialogues with two distinct speakers. Simply format your "
"text with \"SpeakerName:\" to assign voices.\n"
"- Advanced Voice Control: Fine-tune the output by adjusting the temperature "
"for more creative or stable results, and provide custom style instructions.\n"
"- Quick Speak: Speak selected text or clipboard text immediately with "
"separate model, voice, and style settings while keeping focus in the current "
"application.\n"
"- Seamless Workflow: The add-on provides instant audio playback upon "
"generation and allows you to save the resulting .wav file for later use.\n"
"\n"
"To get started, obtain a Gemini API key from Google AI Studio and enter it "
"in the add-on's settings panel, found under NVDA's Tools menu."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Short release notes shown for this add-on version.
msgid ""
"- Added Quick Speak for selected text (NVDA+Alt+E) and clipboard text "
"(NVDA+Alt+Shift+E), with configurable model, voice, style, volume, and "
"internal playback.\n"
"- Migrated Gemini Live features to a direct WebSocket API and improved "
"connection timeouts, retries, server errors, and cancellation.\n"
"- Improved Quick Speak with high thinking for Gemini 3.1 Flash Live Preview, "
"silent routine states, protected-field blocking, focus preservation, key-"
"repeat suppression, and stale playback protection.\n"
"- Improved Talk With AI with saved audio devices and volume, better default-"
"device selection, safer playback interruption and shutdown, and more "
"reliable screen sharing.\n"
"- Updated accessibility, error announcements, translations, and "
"documentation. Tested through NVDA 2026.2 while retaining NVDA 2024.1 as the "
"minimum supported version.\n"
"- See changelog.md for full details.\n"
msgstr ""
"- Se añadió Quick Speak para el texto seleccionado (NVDA+Alt+E) y el texto "
"del portapapeles (NVDA+Alt+Mayús+E), con modelo, voz, estilo, volumen y "
"reproducción interna configurables.\n"
"- Se migraron las funciones de Gemini Live a una API WebSocket directa y se "
"mejoraron los tiempos de espera, los reintentos, los errores del servidor y "
"la cancelación de la conexión.\n"
"- Se mejoró Quick Speak con razonamiento alto para Gemini 3.1 Flash Live "
"Preview, estados rutinarios silenciosos, bloqueo de campos protegidos, "
"conservación del foco, supresión de repetición de teclas y protección contra "
"reproducciones obsoletas.\n"
"- Se mejoró Talk With AI guardando los dispositivos de audio y el volumen, "
"con una mejor selección del dispositivo predeterminado, interrupción y cierre "
"de reproducción más seguros y una pantalla compartida más fiable.\n"
"- Se actualizaron la accesibilidad, los anuncios de errores, las traducciones "
"y la documentación. Probado hasta NVDA 2026.2, manteniendo NVDA 2024.1 como "
"versión mínima compatible.\n"
"- Consulte changelog.md para obtener todos los detalles.\n"

